%[text] ### 2.2 Pressure Sensors Signal Verification (Data Integrity Verification)
%[text] **Objective:** verify the impact of the ignition mechanism (Channel 4 (Y)) on pressure sensors. Time when ignition tigger
%[text] **Workflow:**
%[text] 1. extract Test 1 pressure channel (Y\[0\]) and trigger channel (Y\[3\])
%[text] 2. convert pressure to kPa
%[text] 3. plot both channels with dual y-axes for time alignment check \
%[text] #### 2.2.1 Ignition **Trigger Misalignment & Synchronization Failure**
